<title>UK: Goldman Sachs sets warrants on the DAX index. [CORRECTED 12:55 GMT 13/9]</title>
<headline>Goldman Sachs sets warrants on the DAX index. [CORRECTED 12:55 GMT 13/9]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs &amp; Co said it has issued ten million European-style call and put warrants, in two equal tranches, on the DAX index. Call warrant holders will receive 10 marks at maturity if the DAX never closes below 2,300 during the life of the warrant.</p>
<p>Put warrant holders will receive 10 marks if the DAX never closes above 2,800 during the life of the warrant.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	09.JUN.97		 PAYDATE	23.SEP.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   FRFT, DUSS, STUTT     MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  2540</p>
<p>* * * * * * *</p>
<p>	    STRIKE	    ISSUE	   PREMIUM	GEARING</p>
<p>CALL	2540		7.50 DEM	29.53 PCT    3.39 X</p>
<p>PUT	 2540		7.31 DEM	28.78 PCT    3.47 X</p>
<p>(Corrects terms of Call and Put warrants and strike prices).</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
